Mutation
- [N1] Node-level mutation: element=guard(b1,n3,"v1 = 'Yes'"); source=i3:is to send a negative email; reason=The model arbitrarily translates the specific decision into a generic 'v1 = Yes' boolean instead of capturing the text's actual condition.
- [N2] Node-level mutation: element=guard(b1,n4,"v1 = 'No'"); source=i5:is to invite the candidate; reason=The model arbitrarily translates the specific decision into a generic 'v1 = No' boolean instead of capturing the text's actual condition.